  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; ss by #7225, eff 3-31-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1200) ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2904.03); ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13865, eff 2-6-24",
